        "revision": 1329389874,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "Ground plum has a large and deep taproot. It can only be grown from seed and it is also slow to germinate. The ripe seeds are glossy black with a very hard seed coat.",
        "truncated": false
      }
